1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,610
(Leonard:)Why would I want
to do that?

2
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:04,380
(Sheldon:)Excellent question.

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:07,320
(Sheldon:)Do you remember
what happened to the alien,

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:10,070
(Sheldon:)played by talented character
actor Frank Gorshin,

5
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:14,190
in the Star Trek episode "Let
That Be Your Last Battlefield"?

6
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:18,130
(Leonard:)Uh, Captain Kirk activated
the self-destruct sequence

7
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:20,360
and threatened to blow up
the Enterprise

8
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,600
(Leonard:)and kill them both
unless he gave in?

9
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,870
(Sheldon:)Affirmative.

10
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:27,900
(Sheldon:)Computer, this is
Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

11
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:31,410
(Sheldon:)Activate self-destruct sequence.

12
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:34,010
(Sheldon:)Code 1-1-A-2-B.

13
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:36,680
FEMALE COMPUTER VOICE:
Self-destruct sequence
activated.

14
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,720
(Sheldon:)What are you
gonna do, Sheldon,

15
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,120
(Leonard:)blow up the apartment?

16
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:48,560
(Sheldon:)That was my first thought,
but all my cool stuff is here.

17
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:51,130
(Priya:)So what happens
when it counts down?

18
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:53,360
(Sheldon:)Unless Leonard signs
the new agreement

19
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:55,410
(Sheldon:)in the next 41 seconds,

20
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:59,370
(Sheldon:)this computer will send an
e-mail to your parents in India

21
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:01,600
(Sheldon:)saying that you're in
a secret relationship

